0031:     foreground sprites; a full-grid one-cell frame may surround the scene.
0032: 
0033:     Rule
0034:     Remove any full-grid rectangular frame, sort the remaining sprites by pixel
0035:     area from smallest to largest, and paste their bounding-box sprites left to
0036:     right with each sprite bottom-aligned.
0037: 
0038:     Key insight
0039:     The original locations do not determine the final slots; each sprite's area
0040:     gives the packing order, while its shape and color are preserved.
